LOGBOOK.md-276-- FINDING: Read `com.apple.security.app-sandbox` off three shipping Developer-ID host/provider pairs on this Mac: hosts `false` in all three (Tailscale, PureVPN, Surfshark), providers `true` in all three. Apple requires the **provider system extension** to be sandboxed; the containing app is not covered by that rule for direct distribution. r1 attributed both to a single Apple requirement.
