LOGBOOK.md-313-- FIX: Added file-private `ProviderFailureAdmission` (`NSLock`-guarded claim flag) in `Sources/ReluxTunnelCore/ProviderLifecycle.swift:461`. `providerDidFail` now claims admission **synchronously** before spawning the task (`ProviderLifecycle.swift:907`); later and concurrent callers are dropped before reaching the actor. `startGeneration` releases the claim when it bumps `latestGeneration` (`ProviderLifecycle.swift:632`), keeping admission generation-scoped exactly as the old ledger was.
LOGBOOK.md-314-- DECISION: Removed `cancelTunnelIssuedGeneration` rather than keeping it as a second guard. With synchronous admission it is unreachable-by-construction, and two independent exactly-once authorities on the same callback invite divergence later. `handleProviderFailure` now calls `cancelTunnelWithError` unconditionally.
