t row, profile row, record, assertion, assertion scope, open constraint, dependency edge or Ceremony C1 mutation set changed; no product source, spec or generated project modified. Ready for review.\nagent completed: [analyst] solution-architect (claude) (exit=0)\nspawn run completed: claude (run=RUN-260728-1e0752, pid=84724, exit=0)\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[claude,codex], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\nspawn launch composition: degraded_contract_unavailable; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=codex; schema=1; diagnostic=composition_contract_unavailable; bare child launch retained\nspawn queued: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260728-ad8159, max_parallel=1)\nspawn run started: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260728-ad8159)\nagent completed: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (exit=0)\nspawn run completed: codex (run=RUN-260728-ad8159, pid=18814, exit=0)
